==Strategy==
You will need plenty of meatshields for this stage, preferably fast ones such as [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]]. You may even need a Rich Cat due to the fact that all of the enemies spawn on a timer. Healer and Wyvern are the main threats. For Healer, any attackers with above 310 range will be helpful. For Wyvern, it is recommended you stall it until Healer is killed before proceeding with it. Once you do take care of Healer, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] can be used to deal burst damage. Once Wyvern is down, all thats left is to destroy the enemy base while holding off the peons of course.

